    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823680/extras/74397fe301b2c43c9e90c4851fcdb9bd.avif?t=1753365116\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span>Are you ready to die and die again? Welcome to the Maze, a gigantic and mysterious structure that will challenge your reflexes and agility.\u00a0Get ready for an a-MAZE-ing experience, a short game and a fun run!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore multiple rooms, get out of this maze, and try not to get lasered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823680/extras/8d147e71434965164e3d965ac54efbd4.poster.avif?t=1753365116\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823680/extras/8d147e71434965164e3d965ac54efbd4.webm?t=1753365116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823680/extras/8d147e71434965164e3d965ac54efbd4.mp4?t=1753365116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a short game (around 30 minutes) made by one dev.\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823680/extras/74397fe301b2c43c9e90c4851fcdb9bd.avif?t=1753365116\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span>Are you ready to die and die again? Welcome to the Maze, a gigantic and mysterious structure that will challenge your reflexes and agility.\u00a0Get ready for an a-MAZE-ing experience, a short game and a fun run!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore multiple rooms, get out of this maze, and try not to get lasered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823680/extras/8d147e71434965164e3d965ac54efbd4.poster.avif?t=1753365116\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823680/extras/8d147e71434965164e3d965ac54efbd4.webm?t=1753365116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823680/extras/8d147e71434965164e3d965ac54efbd4.mp4?t=1753365116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a short game (around 30 minutes) made by one dev.\u00a0</p>",
